<p>Rewards.xls is used to set up rewards given to players upon the completion of a <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Plot" title="Plot">plot</a>.
</p><p>Once the custom version of rewards.GDA is in the export folder for the module, the toolset must be restarted to make the new rewards visible to the plot editor.
</p>
