<p>By default, the XP award is only 50% of the specified value. This is hard-coded in sys_rewards_h.  
</p><p>There is a <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Bug%20-%20DLC%20conflicts%20with%20standalone%20campaigns" title="Bug: DLC conflicts with standalone campaigns">bug</a> which means that even standalone campaigns should use very high row id numbers.
